<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="tool-grid" data-stagger><a class="tool-card rv" data-tilt href="/insurance-claim-calculators/settlement-gap-calculator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-desk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-desk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-desk.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="960" height="631" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge"><i>$</i>Calculator</span></span><span class="bd"><h2 style="font-size:1.12rem">Settlement Gap Calculator</h2><p>Size the disputed amount, test award scenarios, subtract fees and find the break-even point.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" data-tilt href="/insurance-claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge"><i>ACV</i>Calculator</span></span><span class="bd"><h2 style="font-size:1.12rem">RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><p>Split a replacement-cost claim into the first check, the depreciation held back and the final total.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" data-tilt href="/insurance-claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-shingles.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge"><i>▲</i>Calculator</span></span><span class="bd"><h2 style="font-size:1.12rem">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</h2><p>Turn a footprint into true roof squares, bundles and the ice-and-water barrier a cold-climate roof needs.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" data-tilt href="/insurance-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-sky.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-sky-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-sky.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge"><i>%</i>Calculator</span></span><span class="bd"><h2 style="font-size:1.12rem">Percentage Deductible Calculator</h2><p>See a wind/hail percentage deductible in dollars and how much less a storm claim would pay.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" data-tilt href="/insurance-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge"><i>◷</i>Planner</span></span><span class="bd"><h2 style="font-size:1.12rem">Claim Timeline Planner</h2><p>Map notice, proof-of-loss, depreciation and suit dates from your date of loss, then export them.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" data-tilt href="/insurance-claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-quiz/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-review.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-review-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-review.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge"><i>✓</i>Checklist</span></span><span class="bd"><h2 style="font-size:1.12rem">Appraisal Readiness Quiz</h2><p>Answer 12 yes/no questions to score your claim file and get a to-do list before demanding appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" data-tilt href="/insurance-claim-calculators/roof-snow-load-calculator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge"><i>❄</i>Calculator</span></span><span class="bd"><h2 style="font-size:1.12rem">Roof Snow Load Calculator</h2><p>Estimate how heavy the snow and ice on your roof are and compare them with a design load.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv-l"><span class="kicker">A sensible order</span><h2>Using the calculators together</h2><ol><li>Start with the <a href="/insurance-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/">claim timeline planner</a> so no deadline slips.</li><li>Check the roof math with the <a href="/insurance-claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/">roof pitch &amp; squares calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’ll actually receive with the <a href="/insurance-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/">percentage deductible</a> and <a href="/insurance-claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV/ACV holdback</a> calculators.</li><li>Size the dispute with the <a href="/insurance-claim-calculators/settlement-gap-calculator/">settlement gap calculator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/insurance-claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-quiz/">appraisal readiness quiz</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv-r"><div class="box call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through, free</h2><p>Tell us what the insurer paid and what the repair costs. We’ll say honestly whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="call-num" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn gold" href="/contact-us/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
